  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Resilience Initiative for Entrepreneurs (ARIE) | Emigoh Dairy Processing Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Milk and youghurt production.2800 beneficiaries, 1370 women. Emigoh seeks to increase its capacity of dairy and fruit products by acquiring a van for distributing their products to and from the market to the processing facility, agprocessing training for the 77+ employees, equipment to increase production, and milk/fruit for raw materials.</narrative>
